        Document EFAULT and EINVAL errors
            I encountered these errors while writing testcase for migra=
te_pages
            syscall for LTP (Linux test project).

            I checked stable kernel tree 3.5 to see which paths return =
these.
            Both can be returned from get_nodes(), which is called from=
