            SYSCALL_DEFINE4(migrate_pages, pid_t, pid, unsigned long, m=
axnode,
                            const unsigned long __user *, old_nodes,
                            const unsigned long __user *, new_nodes)

            The testcase does following:
            EFAULT
            a) old_nodes/new_nodes is area mmaped with PROT_NONE
            b) old_nodes/new_nodes is area not mmapped in process addre=
ss
               space, -1 or area that has been just munmmaped

            EINVAL
